# Modula-2: ISO/IEC 10514-1:1996 and Wirth, "Programming in Modula-2" (4th ed.); requirements/languages/modula2.md
name     modula2 modula-2 mod def

keyword  AND ARRAY BEGIN BY CASE CONST DEFINITION DIV DO ELSE ELSIF END EXCEPT EXIT EXPORT FINALLY FOR
keyword  FROM IF IMPLEMENTATION IMPORT IN LOOP MOD MODULE NOT OF OR PACKEDSET POINTER PROCEDURE QUALIFIED
keyword  RECORD REM REPEAT RETRY RETURN SET THEN TO TYPE UNTIL VAR WHILE WITH
type     INTEGER CARDINAL REAL LONGREAL LONGINT BOOLEAN CHAR BITSET PROC ADDRESS WORD
builtin  TRUE FALSE NIL ABS CAP CHR ORD INC DEC HALT NEW DISPOSE HIGH MAX MIN SIZE VAL INCL EXCL

block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "
string   ' '
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/=#<>&~:^|
calls
